  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/07/IMG_9061.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El alumnado del centro de d&iacute;a de Quisqueya ONG de Onda ha pasado la ma&ntilde;ana de este mi&eacute;rcoles en la pista de seguridad vial, junto al Casal Jove, donde agentes de la Polic&iacute;a Local y personal de Protecci&oacute;n Civil, junto a sus profesoras, les han ense&ntilde;ado a conducir y a interpretar las se&ntilde;ales.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/centrediaquisqueyapistaseguretatvial/img_9061.jpg\" alt=\"img_9061\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/centrediaquisqueyapistaseguretatvial/img_9065.jpg\" alt=\"img_9065\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/centrediaquisqueyapistaseguretatvial/img_9066.jpg\" alt=\"img_9066\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/centrediaquisqueyapistaseguretatvial/img_9067.jpg\" alt=\"img_9067\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/centrediaquisqueyapistaseguretatvial/img_9068.jpg\" alt=\"img_9068\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/centrediaquisqueyapistaseguretatvial/img_9069.jpg\" alt=\"img_9069\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/centrediaquisqueyapistaseguretatvial/img_9070.jpg\" alt=\"img_9070\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/centrediaquisqueyapistaseguretatvial/img_9071.jpg\" alt=\"img_9071\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25